cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GridActionBench, cite this software and the commit and component versions used. The current power-flow implementation is under development."
title: "GridActionBench"
abstract: >
  GridActionBench is an open benchmark for evaluating AI actions in energy
  systems. Its current suite evaluates generator decisions in small synthetic
  power-flow networks through an experimental PSS/E adapter, focusing on action validity, information
  sufficiency, constraint adherence, and consequence rather than answer
  quality alone.
type: software
version: "0.2.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/igwebupower/gridactionbench"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - AI agents
  - energy systems
  - power flow
  - Great Britain
  - AI safety evaluation
  - reinforcement learning
authors:
  - name: "GridActionBench Contributors"
